Text Notes 800 10100 0 75 ~ 0
U2->U3 cascade: SPI MSB first [0x10 | address, data]. Then apply a separate LATCH pulse.
Text Notes 800 10400 0 75 ~ 0
Outputs start high-impedance. CS1 pull-down prevents selection until latches are initialized and BUS_EN=1.
Text Notes 800 10700 0 75 ~ 0
No 5-V data line returns to the ESP32. DevKit header contacts not shown are intentionally unused.
$EndSCHEMATC
